+<?php /** Template Name: Studio */ get_header(); ?>
+<main id="primary" tabindex="-1">
+<?php ff_intro( 'The studio / Form & Field', 'Attention is our starting point.', 'We believe the most compelling spaces feel both inevitable and deeply personal. They grow out of the lives within them and the places around them.' ); ?>
+<section class="about-composition container section"><figure><?php ff_image( 'detail', '', true ); ?><figcaption>A study in time, texture and the edges of light. Illustrative photograph.</figcaption></figure><div data-reveal><p class="eyebrow">Our philosophy</p><h2>Less noise.<br><em>More meaning.</em></h2><p>We are an independent architecture and interiors practice with a simple interest: how places can support a richer everyday life. A generous window seat, a well-placed threshold or a room that catches the morning sun can matter as much as a grand gesture.</p><p>Our approach starts with observation. Before drawing something new, we ask what is already working, what deserves to stay and what the place is asking for.</p></div></section>
+<?php get_template_part( 'template-parts/content', 'style-pillars' ); ?>
+<section class="section container editorial-split"><p class="eyebrow">Working together</p><div><h2>A small practice.<br><em>A wider conversation.</em></h2><p class="lead">Good work is a shared effort. Clients bring lived experience. Consultants bring specialist knowledge. Makers bring an understanding of how things come together.</p><p>We make room for those perspectives through focused reviews, legible drawings and honest discussion of scope and cost. Decisions are recorded, questions are welcomed, and each stage has a clear purpose.</p><a class="text-link" href="<?php echo ff_url( '/services/' ); ?>">See where we can help ↗</a></div></section>
+<?php get_template_part( 'template-parts/content', 'cta-banner' ); ?>
+</main><?php get_footer(); ?>
