+<article class="prose container section"><h2>About this demonstration</h2><p>Form &amp; Field is a fictional architecture and interiors practice. The concept studies, service descriptions and project inquiry form demonstrate a complete sample website.</p><h2>The inquiry form</h2><p>The form is a local demonstration. Its review control checks required fields in your browser and shows a notice. The theme does not send, save or email the entries. Please use sample information rather than personal or confidential project details.</p><h2>Local assets and browsing</h2><p>The theme loads its photography, styles and scripts from the site itself. It adds no analytics, advertising trackers, remote fonts or tracking cookies. Your hosting provider, WordPress installation or installed plugins may process technical request information independently.</p><h2>External photography credits</h2><p>The footer links to the original photographers and the stock-image license. Following one of those links takes you to an external website with its own privacy practices.</p><h2>Before a real practice uses this site</h2><p>The operator must replace this note with information that accurately reflects its hosting, contact service, plugins and data practices. This sample is not a statement about any real organisation.</p><a class="text-link" href="<?php echo ff_url( '/contact/' ); ?>">Return to the sample inquiry ↗</a></article>
