+<section class="process section container" aria-labelledby="process-title"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">04 / A shared process</p><h2 id="process-title">Listen. Test.<br><em>Make with care.</em></h2></div><div class="process-note"><?php ff_mark( 1 ); ?><p>A conversation becomes a drawing.<br>A drawing becomes a place.</p></div></div>
+    <div class="process-grid"><article data-reveal><span class="drawing-number">01 — Understand</span><h3>Begin with the place.</h3><p>We listen to your brief, walk the site and map the practical constraints. Shared priorities make a stronger starting point.</p></article><article data-reveal><span class="drawing-number">02 — Explore</span><h3>Find the right questions.</h3><p>Plans, models and material samples make options tangible. We test light, scale and use together before settling the direction.</p></article><article data-reveal><span class="drawing-number">03 — Resolve</span><h3>Bring the details together.</h3><p>We coordinate the chosen design with the wider team, making space for clear decisions and careful execution.</p></article></div>
