+<section class="process section container" aria-labelledby="process-title"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">04 / A shared process</p><h2 id="process-title">Listen. Test.<br><em>Make with care.</em></h2></div><div class="process-note"><?php ff_mark( 1 ); ?><p>A conversation becomes a drawing.<br>A drawing becomes a place.</p></div></div>
